#Протокол_Backlog_Schema_Lint_V1<[
Базис:
  Monolithic work/backlog.bvc растёт; bad edits (duplicate ids, broken depends_on, invalid status) должны падать до autonomous worker execution.
Вектор:
  lintBacklogItems() on parseWorkItems() output:
  error: duplicate work.id, missing dependency target, invalid work.status, self-depends_on.
  warning: ready/backlog/claimed without work.next_action, done without evidence (informational).
  warning: short BVC sections (Базис/Вектор/Цель) below workItemBvcQuality limits; --strict-bvc promotes to error.
  error: work.parent_id missing parent, self-parent, parent cycle, parent depends_on child; invalid work.item_kind.
  warning: epic without derived children (work.item_kind=epic).
  CLI: npm run lint:backlog reads intent tree; npm run expand:work-item-bvc aligns short descriptions.
  Included in npm run ci:mandatory alongside test:deterministic.
Цель:
  Roadmap integrity gate для operators и CI.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  protocol.id: backlog-schema-lint-v1
  work.source: define-backlog-schema-lint
  trace.status: verified
]>
